   ],
   "body": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "text": "The enterprise tier is priced per seat with a 50-seat minimum."
    },
    {
     "heading": "Why",
     "text": "Usage pricing was too hard for customers to forecast, and three of eight customers in the research asked for per-seat pricing."
    },
    {
     "heading": "Alternatives considered",
     "text": "- Usage-based pricing (rejected: forecasting).\n- Flat platform fee (rejected: leaves money on the table above 200 seats)."
    }
   ],
